        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "441 months of the US economy, January 1990 to September 2026: unemployment, inflation, payrolls, the Fed funds rate, the 2-year and 10-year Treasury yields, the 30-year mortgage rate and NBER recession months. Latest values and changes against a year earlier are measures that follow the date range in the Filters pane.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data source",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis, FRED (UNRATE, FEDFUNDS, GS10, GS2, CPIAUCSL, PAYEMS, USREC; MORTGAGE30US from Freddie Mac, weekly, averaged by month), retrieved on 19 October 2026 from https://fred.stlouisfed.org. FRED data may be copyrighted by the original sources; see https://fred.stlouisfed.org/legal. Prepared: inflation is the 12-month change of CPIAUCSL and payroll growth the 12-month change of PAYEMS, both computed on the full series before cutting at 1990; the spread is the 10-year minus the 2-year yield; the bands and the Fed stance (12-month change of the Fed funds rate, at least 0.25 points) were added.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Measures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Months = COUNTROWS(USMacro)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#FFB000"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Unemployment (latest) = CALCULATE(AVERAGE(USMacro[Unemployment_rate]), USMacro[Date] = MAX(USMacro[Date]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Consolas",
